topPosts.text:
— Iran is now trying to strike oil tankers beyond the Strait of Hormuz & intentionally cause casualties among the crews, in order to further deter ships from attempting illegal passage.
Captains are currently making up to $100,000 per month by illegally crossing the Strait. But by doing that, they are putting their own lives and their crews’ lives in imminent danger.
@Middle_East_Spectator

